# The Docker host. sshd keeps the first value it reads for a keyword
# (sshd_config(5)), and the common config sets AllowTcpForwarding no,
# which refuses streamlocal too (03 §5.3), so the local forwarding that
# direct-streamlocal to the engine socket needs comes before the Include
# (03 §11.3). The common config names no SFTP subsystem, which a stack
# file read uses (03 §7.16 STK-04), as a distribution's sshd_config does.
AllowTcpForwarding local
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
Include /etc/ssh/fixture/sshd_config.common
